A||||5||Wade87GT||Need help on replacing clutch hyd line/hose||||9||
Z||000000||Wade87GT||02-04-2001||08:33 PM||||Has anybody replaced one of these lines before. I have a pinhole leak in the braided portion. Is this thing really one piece from front to rear? Does the replacement come prebent? The "Book" doesn't give any info.<P>Thanks,<BR>Wade||||reg||9
Z||000001||pherder||02-04-2001||09:08 PM||||14105670 is the part number for the clutch line in an 87 Fiero.<P>Putting it into:<P> <A HREF="http://www.gmpartsdirect.com/parts.cfm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.gmpartsdirect.com/parts.cfm</A>  <P>I get the following:<P>Category GM Part # Description Pack Qty Unit Price Quantity Ext. Price Core Charge S&H approx. Total<BR> <BR>All......14105670..PIPE.ASM...........1.....$58.20................$58.20......$0.00.............$8.88..........$67.08   <P>Shipped price is the $67.08<P>I comes pre-bent but also is bent in half to ship. <P>I got one for my 88 Coupe and it fit and is working for me.      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Paul<BR>------------------<BR>88 Formula<BR>88 Coupe<BR>86 SE<BR>95 GMC<BR>92 Mazda<BR>55 Jones<BR>Sedgwick, KS 67135<BR>pherder@kscable.com<p>[This message has been edited by pherder (edited 02-04-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||Wade87GT||02-04-2001||09:18 PM||||Thanks pherder for the quick responce! How was it putting the line in the car. The front half looks like it will be pretty tricky.||||reg||10
Z||000003||Eric||02-05-2001||09:36 PM||||It's fun.  You just have to take out your spare tire and the bottom of the spare tire well before you do it.  ||||reg||1
Z||000004||KissMySSFiero||02-05-2001||10:13 PM||||in my car the rear line was leaking.  i didnt want to replace the entire line because i figured it would have been too much work.  so i went to a junk yard and picked up a line that i cut off about 12inches from the flex line.  i bent it to make it fit right and then put a compression fitting on it.  been workin for about 6months now.  <P>------------------<BR>JOEJOE Aol:KissMySSFiero <P>88FORMULA<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:KissMySSFiero@netzero.net">KissMySSFiero@netzero.net</A>   <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FORUMSIG1.jpg">       <BR>"There's a fine line between love and beer"<BR><A HREF="http://expage.com/kissmyssfiero" TARGET=_blank>KissMySSFiero.mywebsite.hehe</A>||||reg||1
Z||000005||Wade87GT||02-06-2001||09:09 AM||||Thanks All for the tips. I ordered a new line from gmpartsdirect like pherder suggested. This will go with the GM clutch master and slave I got from them too. I really like their prices.||||reg||7
